<title>USA: S3 says chief financial officer resigns.</title>
<headline>S3 says chief financial officer resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>S3 Inc said Tuesday its Chief Financial Officer George Hervey has resigned to join Galileo Technology.</p>
<p>S3 said in a statement a search is under way to find a replacement. Dale Lindly, corporate controller, will assume the role of acting chief financial officer until a replacement is named.</p>
<p>S3 is a supplier of multimedia acceleration hardware and its associated software.</p>
